Date: Fri, 31 Jul 2026 09:34:08 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 02/13] Add inference configure items and add some debug
 feature  - support sonic model inference device config  - support control
 thread pinning config  - support planner mode inference result dump

Signed-off-by: Mao, Roger <roger.mao@intel.com>
---
